OL,3,GNEWSACouple die following crash in
OL,4,AAberdeenshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple have died following a crash in
OL,7,FAberdeenshire.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,10,Fsingle-vehicle crash, involving a black
OL,11,FKia Sportage, on the A93 between
OL,12,FBanchory and Inchmarlo at about 10:45
OL,13,Fon 10 November.
OL,15,FThe driver, a 78-year-old man, and his
OL,16,Fpassenger, a 76-year-old woman, were
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital with life-threatening
OL,18,Finjuries.
OL,20,FPolice Scotland said the man died on
OL,21,FSaturday, and the woman died on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
